{"id": 20760, "title": "My Daughter", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "my-daughter", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/20760_my-daughter.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我有一个女儿， 她今年五岁。 她的名字叫小宝。 她很可爱， 也很聪明。", "她每天早上七点起床， 穿衣服， 洗脸， 吃东西。 她最喜欢鸡蛋和牛奶。", "她不喜欢学校， 每次去学校都会哭。 她喜欢晚上， 因为晚上可以听我讲故事。", "我爱我的女儿。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我有一個女兒， 她今年五歲。 她的名字叫小寶。 她很可愛， 也很聰明。", "她每天早上七點起床， 穿衣服， 洗臉， 吃東西。 她最喜歡雞蛋和牛奶。", "她不喜歡學校， 每次去學校都會哭。 她喜歡晚上， 因為晚上可以聽我講故事。", "我愛我的女兒。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ yǒu yī gè nǚ ér，  tā jīn nián wǔ suì。  tā de míng zi jiào xiǎo bǎo。  tā hěn kě ài，  yě hěn cōng míng。", "tā měi tiān zǎo shang qī diǎn qǐ chuáng，  chuān yī fu，  xǐ liǎn，  chī dōng xi。  tā zuì xǐ huan jī dàn hé niú nǎi。", "tā bù xǐ huan xué xiào，  měi cì qù xué xiào dōu huì kū。  tā xǐ huan wǎn shang，  yīn wèi wǎn shang kě yǐ tīng wǒ jiǎng gù shi。", "wǒ ài wǒ de nǚ ér。"], "english_paragraphs": ["I have a daughter who is five years old. Her name is Xiaobao. She is cute and smart.", "She gets up at seven o'clock every morning, gets dressed, washes her face, and eats. She likes eggs and milk best.", "She doesn't like school and cries every time she goes to school. She likes evenings because she can listen to me telling stories.", "I love my daughter."], "english_full": "I have a daughter who is five years old. Her name is Xiaobao. She is cute and smart.\n\nShe gets up at seven o'clock every morning, gets dressed, washes her face, and eats. She likes eggs and milk best.\n\nShe doesn't like school and cries every time she goes to school. She likes evenings because she can listen to me telling stories.\n\nI love my daughter.", "vocabulary": [{"word": "", "pinyin": "wǒ", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "yǒu", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "yī", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "gè", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "nǚ ér", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "tā", "translation": "